    <data key="d0">MakeMyTrip Security Operations Center (SOC) Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture for next-gen SOC incorporating telemetry ingestion, big data analytics via Apache Metron and AWS Security Data Lake, and automated incident response using SOAR and AWS WAF.</data>
    <data key="d3">Security &amp; Security Operations</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
